---
title: Slush
author: Judy White
category: Drinks
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@water{7%c}
@sugar{2%c}
@frozen lemonade{12%oz}
@frozen orange juice{12%oz}
@brandy or rum{2%c}
@7-Up

Bring to a boil and boil only until sugar is dissolved. Set off and cool. Add: @frozen lemonade{12%oz}, @frozen orange juice{12%oz}. Can add 2 c of brandy or rum, if desired. Freeze. Add 7-Up to 1/3 glass of mixture.
